kosha additive-identity

  -- the element e such that a + e = a for all a.
  -- for the visheshanam ring: shunya (zero). yukta(x, shunya) = x.
  -- for arithmetic: 0. add(x, 0) = x.

  "identity-element-swarupa"
  "shunya-abheda zero-abheda"
  "addition-drishthanta"
  "ring-sthita monoid-sthita"
  "visheshanam-yukta-yukta"

done
